      <property key="skos:example" value="The European Interoperability Framework (EIF) is an initiative that aims to enhance the ability of European public services to work across borders and sectors. The goal is to increase the efficiency of these services and to promote the digital single market. Here are a few examples of how the EIF can be applied:"/>
