    <element xsi:type="archimate:BusinessService" name="Data Quality" id="id-fb2a0fe3b7294d9c86dcf8df464f32ce">
      <documentation>Definition: Data Quality ABB is a Business Service that enables the implementation of an organization's data quality management capabilities, provisioned via a data quality service delivery mode by, or on behalf of an organization. A Data Quality Business Service comprises any data quality service exposed to ensure the accuracy, completeness, reliability, and timeliness of data within the organization.

Source: EIRA Team

LOST view: OV-Functional Architecture Principles

