    <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="Genericode" id="id-5517ca7dfba542f28ec7b3c8af110d61">
      <documentation>Description: Genericode is a standardized format for defining and exchanging code lists and reference data. It provides a structured and machine-readable representation of code lists, which are collections of codes and their corresponding meanings or descriptions. Genericode is designed to facilitate interoperability and data exchange between different information systems.

Publisher: Advancement of Structured Information Standards (OASIS)

Source: https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/cs02/genericode-v1.0-cs02.html

