    <element xsi:type="archimate:Representation" name="SKOS" id="id-5c5a8f782f994d10adb6c5c535b3c106">
      <documentation>Description:  SKOS plays a crucial role in improving information retrieval, data integration, and semantic interoperability, as it provides a standardized approach to representing and exchanging knowledge. By utilizing SKOS, businesses can enhance the discoverability and accessibility of their knowledge resources, leading to more effective search, navigation, and analysis of information within their systems and applications.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/

LOST view: SV-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/SKOSRepresentation

