Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/Geo-LocalizationApplicationInterface

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/WebServiceApplicationInterface

</documentation>
      <property key="dct:modified" value="2023-11-20"/>
      <property key="skos:definition" value="The Geo-localization Application Service is a web service that provides functionality for determining and retrieving the geographic location of a device, user, or point of interest using various data sources and techniques. It enables applications to integrate location-based features and services, such as mapping, routing, proximity search, and geofencing, into their functionality. The Geo-localization Application Service utilizes a combination of technologies, including GPS, IP geolocation, Wi-Fi positioning, cellular network data, and geospatial algorithms, to accurately determine and track the location information. It offers a standardized and accessible interface for developers to query and utilize location data in their applications, allowing for enhanced user experiences, targeted services, and location-aware functionality"/>
      <property key="eira:definitionSource" value="European Location Framework (ELF)"/>
      <property key="eira:definitionSourceReference" value="https://www.elfproject.eu/"/>
      <property key="eira:concept" value="eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock"/>
      <property key="eira:PURI" value="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/Geo-LocalizationApplicationInterface"/>
      <property key="dct:type" value="egovera:Geo-LocalizationApplicationInterface"/>
      <property key="eira:view" value="TVA-Functional Architecture Principles"/>
      <property key="eira:view" value="TVI-Management Infrastructure Enablers [Motivation]"/>
      <property key="eira:view" value="TVI-Application Integration Infrastructure Enablers [Motivation]"/>
      <property key="eira:view" value="Technical view - application"/>
      <property key="dct:identifier" value="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/Geo-LocalizationApplicationInterface"/>
      <property key="eira:eifLayer" value="TechnicalApplication"/>
      <property key="skos:broader" value="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/WebServiceApplicationInterface"/>
    </element>
    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationInterface" name="Financial Management" id="id-36c4c24465fa4bae9697e6c15906c95e">
      <documentation>Definition: The Financial Management Application Service refers to a software service that facilitates the management and processing of financial operations and transactions within an organization. It encompasses a range of functionalities, including budgeting, accounting, financial planning, reporting, invoicing, and payment processing. The service streamlines financial processes, ensures accurate recording and tracking of financial data, and provides insights into the organization's financial performance. It may integrate with other systems such as Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) systems, banking platforms, and payment gateways to enable seamless financial operations

Source: International Journal of Public Administration and Management Research (IJPAMR)

Source reference: https://www.researchgate.net/publication/331892729_The_Role_of_Financial_Management_Information_Systems_in_the_Public_Sector

LOST view: TVA-Functional Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/FinancialManagementApplicationInterface

ABB name: egovera:FinancialManagementApplicationInterface

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-11-20

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/FinancialManagementApplicationInterface

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Specialises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/WebServiceApplicationInterface

</documentation>
