    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Keycloak" id="id-07948283665c4fc1a76a1a2c32a88038">
      <documentation>Description: Keycloak is an open-source access management system that enables organizations to manage user authentication, authorization, and identity management for their applications and services. It provides a centralized platform for secure user authentication, single sign-on (SSO), and identity federation across multiple applications and systems.

Publisher: Keycloak

Source: https://www.keycloak.org/

LOST view: TVA-Identification and Access Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KeycloakApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:IdentityMangementApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-08-20

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/KeycloakApplicationService

</documentation>
