    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="EBSI Wallet" id="id-0eea6c1d4c864caa87fe6ae7a3127550">
      <documentation>Description: A digital wallet in the context of EBSI is a type of online storage that lets you securely keep track of your digital assets and information, like digital certificates and digital identity information. It's like a traditional wallet but storing digital information.

Publisher: European Commission

Source: EBSI

LOST view: TVA-Identification and Access Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EBSIWalletApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2024-01-28

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/EBSIWalletApplicationService

Name: EBSI Wallet

Interoperability Layer: TechnicalApplication

Realises: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/IdentificationApplicationService

</documentation>
