    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationService" name="Identification and Registration System (IRS)" id="id-346b4cdf81bf48ca993717864175eeeb">
      <documentation>Definition: The use or consumption of feature provided by an identification and registration system (IRS). An IRS is a Service enabling patient identification among different facilities within a health-care system.

Source: Techopedia

Source reference: https://www.techopedia.com/definition/23915/identity-management-system

Additional information: The IRS digital service is a crucial component in the digital world, providing a secure and efficient method for user identification and registration. It typically involves processes such as user registration, where users provide their details to create an account; user authentication, where the system verifies the user's identity based on the provided credentials; and user management, where the system manages user access rights and personalization settings. The IRS can be used in various sectors, including e-commerce, banking, healthcare, and education, among others. It is designed to protect user data, prevent unauthorized access, and enhance user experience by providing personalized content and settings.

Example: E-commerce platforms
E-commerce platforms use IRS to register and authenticate users, allowing them to make purchases, track orders, and receive personalized recommendations.

Online banking
Banks use IRS to provide customers with secure access to their accounts, enabling them to check balances, make transactions, and manage their accounts securely.

Healthcare systems
Healthcare systems use IRS to manage patient records, allowing healthcare providers to access patient information securely and efficiently.

Educational platforms
Educational platforms use IRS to manage student and staff access to resources, enabling personalized learning experiences and secure access to sensitive information.

LOST view: TVA-Health Patient Summary Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/IdentificationAndRegistrationSystemApplicationService

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

ABB name: egovera:IdentificationAndRegistrationSystemApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-08-20

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/IdentificationAndRegistrationSystemApplicationService

dct:title: Identification And Registration System (IRS) Application Service

</documentation>
