      <property key="skos:note" value="The LBLS is a critical tool for laboratories, especially those dealing with a high volume of samples. It eliminates manual errors and speeds up the process of sample identification and tracking. The system generates unique barcodes for each sample, which can be scanned to retrieve all relevant information about the sample. This includes details such as the sample type, collection date, patient information, and test results. The LBLS can be integrated with other laboratory information systems for seamless data exchange. It also supports compliance with regulatory standards by providing a reliable audit trail of all sample handling activities."/>
