    <element xsi:type="archimate:DataObject" name="DCAT" id="id-34d28f10f9b043b39a677d51dcd9d3e8">
      <documentation>Description: DCAT enables a publisher to describe datasets and data services in a catalog using a standard model and vocabulary that facilitates the consumption and aggregation of metadata from multiple catalogs. This can increase the discoverability of datasets and data services.

Publisher: W3C

Source: https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/

LOST view: SV-Agnostic Ontologies

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/DCATDataObject

