    <element xsi:type="archimate:Principle" name="Technology Neutrality" id="id-a829f1740b11459fb5d50ac1b1012d5d">
      <documentation>Description: Laws and regulations are technology neutral

Publisher: ELAP

Source: Technological neutrality and data portability Underlying Principle (5) of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF)

Last modification: 2024-01-11

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/2sa/elap/technology-neutrality

