    <element xsi:type="archimate:Grouping" name="Business Agnostic Privacy Solutions" id="id-2979f948d4624a879d2061fd24417e94">
      <documentation>Description: Privacy Solutions ABB is a grouping that refers to actual solutions that facilitate the secure storage, management, and distribution of sensitive information such as passwords, API keys, and encryption keys across various applications and systems. It is designed to ensure the privacy and security of data in a digital environment.

Additional information: Privacy Solutions ABB is a collection of digital services solutions that are primarily focused on providing secure and private storage and access to sensitive data. The group includes tools like HashiCorp Vault, an open-source tool designed for securely storing and accessing sensitive information. Vault provides a centralized system for managing secrets and ensures their secure distribution across applications and systems. The primary purpose of these solutions is to ensure that sensitive data, such as passwords, API keys, and encryption keys, are securely stored and only accessible to authorized entities. These solutions are critical in maintaining data privacy and security in various digital environments, including cloud-based systems, mobile applications, and other digital platforms.

Example: An example of Privacy Solutions ABB in action is the use of HashiCorp Vault in a cloud-based application. The application may need to store and access various sensitive data, such as user passwords and API keys. Instead of storing this data directly in the application, which could be vulnerable to attacks, the application uses Vault. Vault securely stores the sensitive data and only provides access to it when the application needs it. This ensures that the sensitive data is securely stored and managed, reducing the risk of data breaches and unauthorized access.

Publisher: EIRA Team Research

LOST view: TVA-Privacy Enablers [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticPrivacySolutionsGrouping

EIRA traceability: eira:DigitalSolutionApplicationService

EIRA concept: eira:SolutionBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2023-08-20

dct:identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/BusinessAgnosticPrivacySolutionsGrouping

dct:title: Privacy Solutions Catalogue

</documentation>
