      <property key="skos:note" value="The elements of BAOS include W3C Organization, W3C Shapes Constraint Language (SHACL), PROV-O, FOAF, DCAT-AP, ADMS, ADMS-AP, DCAT, and ODRL. These elements provide a set of classes, properties, and restrictions that can be used to represent and interchange provenance information generated in different systems and under different contexts. They also provide a language and framework for describing and validating the structure and constraints of RDF graphs, a collection of basic terms for machine-readable Web homepages, and a specification for metadata records to meet the specific application needs of data portals in Europe."/>
