    <element xsi:type="archimate:Grouping" name="Health Data Policy Solutions" id="id-9907fc4cfb864ef6a1d62d22f209ae8c">
      <documentation>Definition: Health Data Policy Solutions ABB is a Grouping that covers a range of policies, guidelines, and strategies aimed at improving the management, exchange, and use of health data. The elements within this grouping are designed to support the development of interoperability of health data systems, with a focus on enhancing the efficiency and effectiveness of health care services.

Source: EIRA Team Research

Additional information: The Health Data Policy Solutions ABB includes elements such as the 'European ePrescription guidelines for electronic exchange'. This particular element represents European guidelines that assist Member States in developing the interoperability of ePrescriptions. Interoperability in this context refers to the ability of different information systems, devices, and applications to access, exchange, interpret, and cooperatively use data in a coordinated manner, within and across organizational boundaries, to provide timely and seamless portability of information and optimize the health of individuals and populations. These guidelines are crucial in ensuring that ePrescriptions can be effectively exchanged between different health systems, thereby improving the efficiency of health care services and ensuring patient safety.

Example: An example of the application of the 'European ePrescription guidelines for electronic exchange' would be its use by Member States to develop their own national ePrescription systems. These guidelines would provide a framework for ensuring that these systems are able to effectively exchange ePrescriptions with systems in other Member States, thereby facilitating cross-border health care and ensuring that patients are able to receive the medications they need, regardless of where they are in the European Union.

LOST view: SV-Healt Governance Architecture Principles

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/HealthDataPolicySolutionsGrouping

