    <element xsi:type="archimate:Grouping" name="Health Dataset Solutions" id="id-9c9f1976877849bfafd22cce5887da2b">
      <documentation>Definition: Health Dataset Solutions is a grouping that covers a range of data sets, each containing specific metadata related to various aspects of health and healthcare. These data sets are designed to support research, patient information, diagnosis processes, patient summaries, health enterprise resource planning, caregiver data, integrated care pathways, and data about patients' relatives.

Source: EIRA Team Research

Additional information: The Health Dataset Solutions is a comprehensive collection of data sets, each containing specific metadata. The 'Health synthetic metadata' is an artificially created data set for research purposes. 'Information to patients metadata' contains data related to information that can be provided directly to patients. 'Diagnosis metadata' includes all necessary metadata for handling diagnosis processes and activities. 'European patient summary metadata' and 'Patient summary metadata' contain all necessary metadata for managing patient summaries. 'Health ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) metadata' includes metadata for managing health processes of hospitals such as scheduling, supplier information, waiting lists, etc. 'Caregivers metadata' contains data required for the collection of caregiver data. 'Integrated care pathways metadata' contains information related to different care pathways. Finally, 'Relatives metadata' contains all necessary metadata for the collection of data about patients' relatives.

Example: For instance, the 'Diagnosis metadata' can be used by healthcare providers to streamline and enhance the diagnosis process. The 'Health ERP metadata' can be utilized by hospital administrators to efficiently manage resources and schedules. Similarly, 'Caregivers metadata' can be used by home healthcare agencies to better understand and manage caregiver data.

LOST view: SV-Datasets Catalogue [Motivation]

Identifier: http://data.europa.eu/dr8/egovera/HealthDatasetSolutionsGrouping

