            <documentation>NARRATIVE:
The TVA-Health eDispensation Enablers [Motivation] view extends Technical view - application and provides a comprehensive framework for leveraging various elements to facilitate health eDispensation. 

The first element is the &quot;Health eDispensation Enablers&quot; which is a Grouping ABB. This grouping comprises two Application Service ABBs: the &quot;Pharmacy Information System (PIS)&quot; and the &quot;Medicines/Medications System (MS)&quot;. These systems are designed to provide application services for managing pharmacy information and medicines/medications respectively.

The second element is the &quot;eGovERA Health Digital Public Services Catalogue&quot;, a Diagram Model-group ABB. This catalogue includes a Business Service ABB named &quot;Healthcare enterprise resource management&quot;. This service is designed to enable the management of resources within the healthcare system.

The third element is the &quot;Business Agnostic Digital Public Services Catalogue&quot;, another Diagram Model-group ABB. This catalogue includes two Business Service ABBs: &quot;Knowledge Management&quot; and &quot;Data Exchange&quot;. These services are designed to provide digital public services for managing knowledge and exchanging data respectively.

The fourth element is the &quot;Health eDispensation Data Exchange Technical Interoperability Agreement Solutions&quot;, a Grouping ABB. This grouping includes two Contract SBBs: &quot;SCRIPT - ePrescription exchange&quot; and &quot;IHE DIS: Pharmacy Dispense&quot;. These contracts are designed to facilitate the exchange of ePrescriptions and the dispensing of pharmacy items respectively.

In summary, this view provides a comprehensive framework that leverages various elements to facilitate health eDispensation. These elements include application services, business services, and contracts that are designed to manage pharmacy information, medicines/medications, healthcare resources, knowledge, data, ePrescriptions, and pharmacy dispensing.
</documentation>
            <property key="eira:businessDomain" value="health"/>
          </element>
