            <documentation>Narrative: &#xD;
The &quot;Technical view - Application Digital Workplace&quot; viewpoint  extends technical view application and provides a comprehensive framework for facilitating digital collaboration, communication, and productivity within organizations. This view associates the Application Digital Workplace with Digital Workplace Business Services from the application layer.&#xD;
Within this view, the Application Digital Workplace represents the digital platform or suite of applications that enable employees to perform their work-related tasks, collaborate with colleagues, access resources, and engage in communication within a digital environment. It encompasses tools such as messaging apps, document sharing platforms, task management systems, and virtual meeting applications.&#xD;
Digital Workplace Business Services leverage the Application Digital Workplace to provide employees with a centralized and integrated digital work environment. These services enable seamless collaboration, efficient communication, and easy access to business resources, fostering productivity and teamwork within organizations.&#xD;
By associating the Application Digital Workplace with Digital Workplace Business Services, the &quot;Technical view - Application Digital Workplace&quot; promotes a cohesive and user-friendly digital work environment, enabling employees to work efficiently and effectively.&#xD;
The use of the Application Digital Workplace allows employees to access relevant information, collaborate on projects, and communicate with colleagues regardless of their physical location. It provides a unified platform where employees can find and access the tools and resources they need to perform their work tasks.</documentation>
          </element>
