            <documentation>Narrative: &#xD;
The &quot;Technical view - Application Data Management&quot; viewpoint extends technical view application and provides a comprehensive framework for managing and organizing data within digital applications. This view associates the Application Data Management with Data Management Business Services from the application layer.&#xD;
Within this view, Application Data Management encompasses the processes, technologies, and practices employed to ensure the effective storage, retrieval, and manipulation of data within digital applications. It involves the implementation of data models, data governance strategies, and data integration techniques.&#xD;
Digital applications leverage Application Data Management to ensure the accuracy, consistency, and accessibility of data. By utilizing Data Management Business Services, organizations can establish robust data management practices that support data quality, data security, and data governance within the digital ecosystem.&#xD;
By associating Application Data Management with Data Management Business Services, the &quot;Technical view - Application Data Management&quot; enables organizations to effectively manage data within their applications, ensuring data integrity and enabling efficient data processing and utilization.&#xD;
The use of Application Data Management allows organizations to define and enforce data standards, establish data validation rules, and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements. It facilitates data integration, allowing applications to access and share data seamlessly, improving overall data consistency and usability.</documentation>
          </element>
